{"name": "Integrity", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Memory is pain, and oblivion is peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Those who fall into the abyss lose their names and their past, knowing only that they must keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dungeon is not kind. It offers no directions, and gives no answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yet the deeper one descends, the more forgotten memories begin to return \u2014 each one painful enough to shake both body and mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is a relentless chain of choices made for survival, and exploration rewards only those who uncover its secrets for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And the deeper you go, the more those you believed to be enemies begin to feel strangely familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What awaits at the end \u2014 salvation, or\u2026 the truth you wished most to avoid?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/dcb2e3bbfee1863c4968b9d51640e8ca.poster.avif?t=1787735451\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/dcb2e3bbfee1863c4968b9d51640e8ca.webm?t=1787735451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/dcb2e3bbfee1863c4968b9d51640e8ca.mp4?t=1787735451\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Integrity is a turn-based tactics game where vision,</strong><br/><strong>terrain, and the weight of each decision determine victory or defeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Even moving a single tile is never a trivial choice. Movement, attacking, repositioning, and retreating all consume the same resource, so every turn demands careful stamina management.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd39 Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategy Through Terrain and Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walls and terrain are not just background elements.<br/>They can become shields, obstacles, and even weapons that force enemies into unfavorable positions.<br/>Hide, block, isolate enemies, and use a variety of skills to control the battlefield in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/8b67349145bea6613674cb5126ceb87a.poster.avif?t=1787735451\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/8b67349145bea6613674cb5126ceb87a.webm?t=1787735451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/8b67349145bea6613674cb5126ceb87a.mp4?t=1787735451\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/305cc82633a018cf359ad4d0b9492e3c.poster.avif?t=1787735451\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/305cc82633a018cf359ad4d0b9492e3c.webm?t=1787735451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/305cc82633a018cf359ad4d0b9492e3c.mp4?t=1787735451\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skill Upgrade System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strengthen the skills you already have to improve their performance.<br/>Push your chosen tactics even further and make your strategy more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/a6f50e7974ac16c785c2efe6292a4ea3.poster.avif?t=1787735451\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/a6f50e7974ac16c785c2efe6292a4ea3.webm?t=1787735451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/a6f50e7974ac16c785c2efe6292a4ea3.mp4?t=1787735451\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/7fa9654c73d859e837731ce8561638bd.poster.avif?t=1787735451\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/7fa9654c73d859e837731ce8561638bd.webm?t=1787735451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/7fa9654c73d859e837731ce8561638bd.mp4?t=1787735451\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Vision-Based Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character can only see the area around them.<br/>Enemies operate under the same rules, and unseen areas always remain a source of uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/f8bd7602dbc2137d9ebeff68621bb389.poster.avif?t=1787735451\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/f8bd7602dbc2137d9ebeff68621bb389.webm?t=1787735451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/f8bd7602dbc2137d9ebeff68621bb389.mp4?t=1787735451\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skill Unlock System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new skills by fulfilling specific actions and conditions.<br/>These new skills can change your entire approach to combat and open up new strategic options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/c7e0cb84cf87eeb1e298ef396fdc7d3d.poster.avif?t=1787735451\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/c7e0cb84cf87eeb1e298ef396fdc7d3d.webm?t=1787735451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306780/extras/c7e0cb84cf87eeb1e298ef396fdc7d3d.mp4?t=1787735451\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0\ud83d\udd39Recommended For Players Who\u2026</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy turn-based tactical strategy games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prefer tactical play that leverages terrain and vision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like build-focused gameplay: unlocking new skills or reinforcing a chosen strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Value decision-making and consequences over simple stat checks</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "If grid-based, board-game-like turn-based combat has ever felt restrictive to you, experience Integrity. Move freely, destroy or create terrain with your skills, and manage line of sight and stamina in 